Popcorn component licenses
==========================

Popcorn is derived from projects by Marcin Kulik and the asciinema contributors.
The original licenses and copyrights continue to apply. Popcorn modifications
are copyright 2026 smeltery and distributed under each component's license.

Component          Upstream project                 License
crates/cli         asciinema/asciinema               GPL-3.0-or-later
crates/agg         asciinema/agg                     GPL-3.0-or-later
crates/avt         asciinema/avt                     Apache-2.0
packages/player    asciinema/asciinema-player        Apache-2.0
apps/server        asciinema/asciinema-server        Apache-2.0

Each component contains the full license in its LICENSE file. Source projects
are available at https://github.com/asciinema/<upstream-project-name>.

The documentation in apps/docs derives from asciinema/asciinema.github.io,
copyright 2023 Marcin Kulik. No blanket license is asserted over upstream
documentation or artwork. Existing third-party licenses, including the player
virtual terminal's MIT/Apache notices and bundled font licenses, remain in force.

Repository-specific build scripts and original repository documentation are
licensed under Apache-2.0; see crates/avt/LICENSE for the full text.

The previous PolyForm Shield notices were incorrect and do not replace the
upstream licenses.
